  "ldInstructionsRaw": [
    "<p>Blend the cookies until they become a fine powder.&nbsp;</p>",
    "<p>Combine with the chopped white chocolate. Heat the milk with the honey and the cane sugar.&nbsp;</p>",
    "<p>Once it begins to boil, pour it over the chocolate and cookies and combine well, then add in the oil. </p>",
    "<p>Let the cream set before distributing it into jars. </p>"
